The actions of Asemu and Zeheart prevented the mobile fortress Downes from falling to Earth.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:56.030
The land was protected by the strong wills of the young men.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.950
One year later... {th ehell, anohter time skip?}

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.390
<i>41 years after The Day Angel Fell, on this Day of Courage,</i>

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:24.310
<i>a memorial ceremony will be held in the capital city of Brucia, which is in a state of high alert.</i>

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:34.030
<i>Prime minister Froi Olfenoa has just arrived, and the city is full of excitement as the ceremony draws nearer.{ and you can see great excitement as the city awaits the ceremony.}</i>

