00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.750
But even so, evil must be judged as evil.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:56.090
History will decide who is right based on the actions we are about to take.

00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:00.010
All this is to protect the Earth from Vagan's hands.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:03.220
Protect... the Earth.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.310
Vagan.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:19.320
A new nation created by those abandoned in the Mars Sphere after the failed settlement plan.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:25.040
Forced to live in this harsh environment,

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:33.960
the Vagan began a grand plan to take back the paradise known as Earth.

