00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:12.890
Episode 28 
Upheaval in the 
Earth Sphere

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.860
Conrad will take the entrance to the national mall on the west side.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.780
Nadia will take the southern entrance to the main plaza.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.200
Security forces are already deployed on the north side.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.160
I'll be watching the hills on the east side.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.160
That is all.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.210
Any questions?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:36.290
<i>You think there's a high chance of attack, don't you?</i>

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.250
Yes.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.630
<i>If they're assigning special forces like us to security detail...{not sure if detail is exactly right here}</i>

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:45.550
It means Earth isn't as safe a place as it used to be.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.050
<i>Exactly.</i>

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:51.470
<i>I've heard rumors that a lot of Vagan are already hiding on Earth, but...</i>

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.020
It's time.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.520
Everyone, take your positions.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.900
Go to radio control level 3.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.190
Limit your communications to emergencies.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.400
<i>Roger.</i>

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.050
When I get to Tordia, it looks like Unoa's going to pick me up.

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.550
You've been in touch with her?

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.010
She was happy.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:28.390
"If my brother's a special forces captain, then he's finally come of age."

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:29.680
That girl.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.680
But having my sister say I've come of age...

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.270
She's really amazing, though.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:42.020
She told me she's running all over 
the place as a medical volunteer.{note the nora, minsry, and fardain departures in the background}

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:47.910
Yeah, she'd happily go to the dark side of the moon if they needed her for something.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.450
I just can't compare.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.040
She's so much more grown up than I am.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.170
I was a kid.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.880
Even when I joined the military, I was still thinking like a student.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:07.380
I admired you and Zeheart,

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.680
and I was constantly chasing after your shadows.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:17.100
I forced my own idealized images onto the two of you out of admiration.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.060
I'm sorry.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.360
I've always wanted to apologize.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.230
Romary.

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.940
There's no need to apologize.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:31.820
If you can still be the same Romary you used to be, that's enough.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.910
Asemu...

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.580
Okay.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:46.630
<i>Flight 103 to relay station has begun boarding.</i>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.170
I have to go.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:50.930
<i>All passengers, please come to the boarding gate.</i>

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.010
Yeah.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:49.760
Romary.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:58.850
I used to be confused, but I think I finally found my real reason for fighting.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:06.110
I want to fight for someone I care about.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:09.200
That feeling will never change.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.620
I'll keep protecting you.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.920
<i>Earth will change today...</i>

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.260
<i>But the fight won't be over.</i>

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.010
<i>I'm not confused any more.</i>

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.520
<i>There's someone I want to protect...</i>

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.180
<i>so I'll keep fighting!</i>

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.880
Ms. Romary!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.850
Welcome home!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.520
What is courage?

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.560
It is a conviction that lets us overcome adversity.{is that garterbelt?}

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.400
What is courage?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:31.860
It is having eyes that can see through the nature of fear.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.780
What is courage?

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:40.450
<i>It is the human life force that conquers the unknown and blazes a trail to the future.</i>

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:44.170
He always gives the most adorable speeches.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.460
Don't you think?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.500
That's right.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.340
His speeches are always truly impressive.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:54.260
<i>We must not forget that day.</i>

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:59.260
<i>The Day Angel Fell, when the space colony Angel was destroyed.</i>

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.680
<i>That day marked the start of our suffering.{Our days of suffering began then.}</i>

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:11.530
<i>With no way to resist the encroaching threat, the Earth Sphere was overrun by our enemies.</i>

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:16.360
<i>But we never forgot our courage!</i>

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:27.120
<i>We fought with pride, and many times we repelled their outrageous attacks.</i>

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:30.960
<i>It was this courage that enabled us to defeat Vagan!</i>

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.760
Bark all you want.{howl}

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.880
We're finished with you now. {we have no use for you any more}

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.810
All is as Lord Ezelcant wills it.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:46.190
People of the Earth Sphere! Keeps your hearts strong!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:49.310
Let us overcome our suffering and fight together!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:54.860
To protect Mother Earth, we must once more show our courage,

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.740
and all fight as one!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.330
