As Prime Minister Olfenoa's wife,

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.270
you probably have a good idea about{ be able to guess} what's going on.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.240
What is this?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.240
What's going on here?

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.330
Flit Asuno!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:50.500
We cannot fight together with you.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.920
What?

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.840
Because you are the enemy!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:00.010
You must be mad.{u mad, bro?}

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.890
Flit Asuno,

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.510
are you aware of who you're addressing?{do you know who you're speaking those words to?}{dem be fighting words}

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.930
Earth Federation Prime Minister Froi Olfenoa.{lolcaps}

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:15.070
Despite your position, you betrayed us and conspired with Vagan.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.860
You sold out the Federation, no, all of Earth!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.240
The situation has changed.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:26.370
We will now dispose of Froi Olfenoa.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:30.120
We shall do as Lord Ezelcant wills!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.580
As Lord Ezelcant wills it!

