Vagan mobile suits have appeared on the ground?!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.060
Just as Team Leader Asemu suspected! {Captian asemuj, why are they usenig Team Leader}

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.100
The north side?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.390
But security is heaviest there...

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.230
Nadia, Conrad!

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.320
The enemy has appeared to the north.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.820
I'll head there now.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.320
But it's possible that could be a diversion.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.620
You stay put, and make sure your areas are well guarded.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.740
<i>Roger!</i>

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.840
I sold out Earth?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:29.850
If you're going to make such a serious accusation, you had better be prepared to back it up, Flit Asuno!{If you can say such things, you should be prepared to back them up, Flit Asuno!}

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:35.190
The Olfenoa family has produced generations of prime ministers,

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.360
and countless other government officials.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:42.780
But your family has been keeping a big secret.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:49.410
The failed Mars settlement project that created Vagan...

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:58.130
The man who planned it and led its cover-up, Dr. Streit Fondor, was part of the Olfenoa bloodline.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.550
Your family has been keeping that fact a secret.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:08.800
A fact that would have been 
devastating to your political career

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:13.980
when you were heavily involved in power struggles to gain the position of prime minister.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.570
Vagan took advantage of this.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:25.570
You had to collaborate with them, 
or the truth would be made public.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.490
I'm impressed you were able to find that out.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:35.460
The man who found out and told me about it was Grodek Ainoa.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.790
A man you had killed!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.840
You were conspiring with Vagan,

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:53.270
and the huge fees you collected as an informant enabled you to climb to your current position.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.060
I'll say it again!{Objection!}

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.350
You sold out the Earth!

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:59.190
That is the undeniable truth!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.100
You're too soft, Earthers!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.580
The Gundam, huh?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:58.910
I didn't expect to see you again.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:14:59.830
Vagan!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:29.700
We have a report that three Vagan mobile suits are heading here from the north side!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.110
They're coming here?!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.370
You're their target.{The target is you.}{a winner is you}

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.620
They're cutting you off.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:40.160
The Vagan caught on to our plans.{Well yeah, you're doing this live on world-wide (I assume) television)}

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:44.000
You've gathered a lot of information by conspiring with Vagan.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.380
There's no way they'll let you live.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.590
They came with mobile suits to kill me?!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.510
You're a symbol of the Federation government's corruption.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:58.430
Perhaps they intend to further embarrass the Federation Forces by killing you as a spy.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.280
<i>Why are you stopping me, Gundam?!</i>

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:16.450
Wh-What?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:22.370
<i>Can't you see the corruption of the Federation Forces now?</i>

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:27.790
If you're still risking your life in battle, you're nothing but a fool!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.840
What are you—!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.710
<i>We Vagan can't lose...</i>

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.510
to an enemy that fights without conviction!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.560
I'll settle things with you later!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.680
Right now, I have a mission!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:44.850
I won't let you go!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.780
Out of my way!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.140
Vagan mobile suits!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.230
Why?

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.980
Why do they have to kill me?

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.860
I've been handling things so well until now...

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:37.030
I kept the trust of Earth, while showing my understanding of Ezelcant's ideals.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.370
Indeed.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:42.160
Both the amount of damage to Earth, and the failure of Vagan's operations...

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:46.080
You were convinced you could 
manipulate them both as you planned.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:52.750
And thanks to my actions, hasn't Earth avoided catastrophic damage?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.300
Because I wasn't just conspiring with Vagan,

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:59.850
I was negotiating with Ezelcant on Earth's behalf!

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.680
Did you think your petty negotiations would have any effect?!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.640
They've just been using you.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:08.850
Look!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.610
This is what you've brought upon yourself!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:21.620
{inb4 asemu}

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.130
Don't worry.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.220
I won't let them kill you.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.220
{induring asemu}

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:55.610
There are still many things you're going to tell me.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:07.290
Without me as a negotiator, Vagan and the Federation Forces will never reach a compromise!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:13.960
This war for Earth will continue until 
one side is completely destroyed!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:17.050
That's been my intention all along.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.630
Because my goal...

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.550
...is the extermination of Vagan!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.890
You're a man obsessed with revenge!

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.480
You'll regret losing me!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.610
How can someone like you protect the Earth?!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:40.740
You can't protect anything without fighting for it.

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:46.910
Why?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.410
Why can you still fight?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.630
I'm not fighting for myself, or for some organization!

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:02.630
There are people who are precious to me.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:11.890
That's why I fight! To keep protecting them!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:20.030
I apologize profusely, Lord Ezelcant.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:25.700
I, Zant, have been defeated... by a mere Earther.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:31.910
I pray my life may become part of Eden's soil...

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.050
I can see it...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.170
Eden!

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.520
AG 142.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:05.450
Prime Minister Froi Olfenoa was executed for treason against the Earth Federation.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:12.500
Many others in the highest levels of government and military were found to have connections with Vagan.{There were many others with connections to Vagan in the highest levels of the government and military.}

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:23.380
The purge committee led by Flit Asuno exposed them all.{sure sounds like red scare}

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.930
The Federation Forces underwent a massive reorganization,

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:34.810
and the Earth Federation Government was soon reborn under new leadership.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:41.070
A new era had begun for the Earth Sphere.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.200
Sleep for now...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.570
You have a role to play in the next era as well...

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:51.700
Zeheart.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:59.000
And once again, the times began to change.

